**How to set it up:**

1. **Install CrookCatcher** from <a href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.harteg.crookcatcher&referrer=utm_source%3Dwebsite%26utm_medium%3Dguide%26utm_campaign%3Dfake-home-screen-android" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Play</a> and finish the setup. Taking the photo and emailing it are free.
2. **Turn on Show fake home screen** in the app's settings for failed unlocks. It's part of CrookCatcher Pro.
3. **Check the preview**, and choose whether a tap on the fake home screen should take another photo.
4. **Test it.** Lock your phone and enter a wrong PIN.

On Xiaomi phones the app asks for a few extra permissions before the fake home screen can appear. Fake home screen and [Show message](/blog/lock-screen-message-android) can't be on at the same time, so pick the one that fits you: a decoy that keeps the person busy, or a message that tells them they've been caught.

